3
00:00:09.984 --> 00:00:16.286
NARRATOR: Algorithm analysis connects a
precise problem specification to a correctness

4
00:00:16.286 --> 00:00:18.578
argument and resource bounds.

5
00:00:18.578 --> 00:00:26.940
NARRATOR: Consider this worked case: A student
defines a problem to find the shortest path in

6
00:00:26.940 --> 00:00:33.211
