10
00:00:46.015 --> 00:00:51.531
NARRATOR: Annotate with 'specification',
'correctness', and 'bounds' labels.

11
00:00:51.531 --> 00:00:57.663
NARRATOR: List the givens before choosing a
method, because an unstated assumption can

12
00:00:57.663 --> 00:00:59.078
