13
00:00:59.078 --> 00:01:04.843
NARRATOR: This establishes the vocabulary and
scope needed for the remaining sections.

14
00:01:04.970 --> 00:01:11.365
NARRATOR: Now define Algorithm Expression in
Pseudo Code precisely enough that another

15
00:01:11.365 --> 00:01:14.029
