49
00:04:09.357 --> 00:04:14.732
NARRATOR: Highlight the condition check and
the update step with distinct colors.

50
00:04:14.732 --> 00:04:21.370
NARRATOR: Compare alternatives against the
same constraints so the evaluation does not

51
00:04:21.370 --> 00:04:23.029
move the goalposts.

52
00:04:23.029 --> 00:04:29.872
NARRATOR: Using shared criteria turns a
preference into a defensible technical choice.

53
00:04:29.978 --> 00:04:35.799
NARRATOR: Apply Problem Solving Using
Recursion to a worked situation instead of

54
00:04:35.799 --> 00:04:38.709
