55
00:04:38.709 --> 00:04:45.115
NARRATOR: Divide-and-conquer algorithms split
a problem, solve subproblems, and combine

56
00:04:45.115 --> 00:04:46.396
their results.

57
00:04:46.396 --> 00:04:52.870
NARRATOR: Consider this worked case: A student
implements a recursive function to traverse a

58
00:04:52.870 --> 00:04:58.881
