65
00:05:24.568 --> 00:05:29.396
NARRATOR: The worked case shows both how to
apply the method and how to check it.

66
00:05:29.498 --> 00:05:35.661
NARRATOR: Examine the tradeoffs in Basic
Searching and Sorting, including what improves

67
00:05:35.661 --> 00:05:38.229
